{"4700280":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Ironfields","steam_appid":4700280,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"dlc":[4867830],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ironfields is a single-player RTS about capturing the battlefield, not building a base from scratch.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each mission starts with key structures already placed across the map. You capture them, repair them, defend them, build towers around them, upgrade your units, and decide when it is finally safe to push forward.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The pace is slower and more tactical than a typical click-heavy RTS. You are not meant to win by fast reflexes. You win by holding the right positions, surviving constant pressure, and using the tools each mission gives you.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4700280\/extras\/6e89ad01f572012e4f8d560ef628f9b1.poster.avif?t=1793728829\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4700280\/extras\/6e89ad01f572012e4f8d560ef628f9b1.webm?t=1793728829\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4700280\/extras\/6e89ad01f572012e4f8d560ef628f9b1.mp4?t=1793728829\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Capture key buildings<\/strong><br>You do not build a traditional base. Instead, you fight for factories, power plants, satellites,  and other strategic structures already placed on the battlefield. Every building you secure changes the balance of the mission.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4700280\/extras\/13ccc402a8a5e91c0bbbcec4cf3b9609.poster.avif?t=1793728829\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4700280\/extras\/13ccc402a8a5e91c0bbbcec4cf3b9609.webm?t=1793728829\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4700280\/extras\/13ccc402a8a5e91c0bbbcec4cf3b9609.mp4?t=1793728829\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive constant enemy pressure<\/strong><br>The enemy does not wait for clean scripted waves. It keeps sending units, forcing you to defend, repair, reposition, and slowly turn the map in your favor.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4700280\/extras\/160a1a63c75c1c988d614e0d32be3b94.poster.avif?t=1793728829\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4700280\/extras\/160a1a63c75c1c988d614e0d32be3b94.webm?t=1793728829\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4700280\/extras\/160a1a63c75c1c988d614e0d32be3b94.mp4?t=1793728829\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use airstrikes and towers to break stalemates<\/strong><br>Some defenses cannot be pushed through by tanks alone. Build towers, upgrade your units, and call in airstrikes when you need to destroy a key target or open a path forward.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ironfields focuses on tactical decisions, map control, and hand-crafted single-player missions inspired by older RTS games.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features<\/strong><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single-player RTS focused on planning and positioning<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No traditional base building<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Capture, repair, and defend battlefield structures<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build towers and upgrade your units<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Call in airstrikes to support your attacks<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slower-paced tactical gameplay<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-crafted missions with strong map-control focus<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built-in layout editor for custom combat layouts<\/p><\/li><\/ul>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ironfields is a single-player RTS about capturing the battlefield, not building a base from scratch.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each mission starts with key structures already placed across the map. You capture them, repair them, defend them, build towers around them, upgrade your units, and decide when it is finally safe to push forward.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The pace is slower and more tactical than a typical click-heavy RTS. You are not meant to win by fast reflexes. You win by holding the right positions, surviving constant pressure, and using the tools each mission gives you.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4700280\/extras\/6e89ad01f572012e4f8d560ef628f9b1.poster.avif?t=1793728829\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4700280\/extras\/6e89ad01f572012e4f8d560ef628f9b1.webm?t=1793728829\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4700280\/extras\/6e89ad01f572012e4f8d560ef628f9b1.mp4?t=1793728829\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Capture key buildings<\/strong><br>You do not build a traditional base. Instead, you fight for factories, power plants, satellites,  and other strategic structures already placed on the battlefield. Every building you secure changes the balance of the mission.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4700280\/extras\/13ccc402a8a5e91c0bbbcec4cf3b9609.poster.avif?t=1793728829\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4700280\/extras\/13ccc402a8a5e91c0bbbcec4cf3b9609.webm?t=1793728829\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4700280\/extras\/13ccc402a8a5e91c0bbbcec4cf3b9609.mp4?t=1793728829\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive constant enemy pressure<\/strong><br>The enemy does not wait for clean scripted waves. It keeps sending units, forcing you to defend, repair, reposition, and slowly turn the map in your favor.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4700280\/extras\/160a1a63c75c1c988d614e0d32be3b94.poster.avif?t=1793728829\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4700280\/extras\/160a1a63c75c1c988d614e0d32be3b94.webm?t=1793728829\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4700280\/extras\/160a1a63c75c1c988d614e0d32be3b94.mp4?t=1793728829\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use airstrikes and towers to break stalemates<\/strong><br>Some defenses cannot be pushed through by tanks alone. Build towers, upgrade your units, and call in airstrikes when you need to destroy a key target or open a path forward.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ironfields focuses on tactical decisions, map control, and hand-crafted single-player missions inspired by older RTS games.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features<\/strong><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single-player RTS focused on planning and positioning<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No traditional base building<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Capture, repair, and defend battlefield structures<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build towers and upgrade your units<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Call in airstrikes to support your attacks<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slower-paced tactical gameplay<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-crafted missions with strong map-control focus<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built-in layout editor for custom combat layouts<\/p><\/li><\/ul>","short_description":"A single-player RTS where you capture existing structures instead of building a base from scratch, and success comes more from good decisions than fast reactions.","supported_languages":"English<strong>*<\/strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*<\/strong>, Czech<strong>*<\/strong>, Polish<strong>*<\/strong>, German<strong>*<\/strong>, Spanish - Spain<strong>*<\/strong>, Russian<strong>*<\/strong>, French<strong>*<\/strong>, Portuguese - Brazil<strong>*<\/strong>, Spanish - Latin America<strong>*<\/strong>, Traditional Chinese<strong>*<\/strong><br><strong>*<\/strong>languages with full audio support","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4700280\/3c2e053566144e341cd562ec0e6008a4c46f0366\/header.jpg?t=1793728829","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4700280\/2e44cc3418357f4829e1210fd4a5b842f24ea7f8\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793728829","capsule_imagev5":"ht